  "_comment": "Negative: offsets on an untyped node. The selector carries an inverted pair and no coordinate system, and both of those rules live on rkaf:TextPositionSelectorShape — which fires only on a node typed oa:TextPositionSelector. Omitting the @type made an unreproducible, inverted region pass every target; §4.2 binds the fragment's declared selectorKind to a TYPED selector so the omission is the violation."
